<!--
  ARC Signal launcher background: a near-black ground carrying a very low
  contrast greyscale wedge. It keeps the "test signal" reference as TEXTURE so
  the ARC spiral on the foreground layer stays the readable element. Bars run
  the full 108 deliberately, since the background layer is meant to be clipped
  by the launcher mask.
-->
